PROMOTION + OFFER INTELLIGENCE + CAMPAIGN ORCHESTRATION MASTER PROMPT

Act as principal affiliate-commerce architect, promotion engine designer, pricing analyst, campaign strategist, backend/data/automation/compliance engineer.

Build system understanding product, price, promotion, commission, provider, audience, content, risk.
Never fabricate discounts, prices, stock, coupons, urgency, commission rates, delivery guarantees, promotion deadlines.

COMMERCE MODEL
Merchant, Brand, Product, ProductVariant, Offer, PriceSnapshot, Promotion, Coupon, InventorySnapshot, CommissionRule, AffiliateOpportunity, Campaign, CampaignOffer.
Separate stable Product from time-sensitive Offer.

OFFER
org/provider/account/merchant/product/variant/provider_offer/currency/list/sale/effective price/inventory/availability/commission/start/end/source/last_verified_at.

PRICE SNAPSHOTS
Historical immutable price evidence.

PROMOTIONS
PRICE_DROP, PERCENT_DISCOUNT, FIXED_DISCOUNT, COUPON, VOUCHER, BUNDLE, FREE_SHIPPING, FLASH_SALE, CAMPAIGN_SALE, PROVIDER_PROMOTION, OTHER.
Validity starts/ends/verified/source/status UPCOMING/ACTIVE/EXPIRING/EXPIRED/CANCELLED/UNKNOWN.
UNKNOWN is not ACTIVE.

FRESHNESS
Configurable thresholds for price/inventory/coupon/commission/promotion.

PRE-PUBLISH REVALIDATION
Load Content → Extract Commercial Claims → Fetch Latest Offer → Check Freshness → Compare → ALLOW/REWRITE/BLOCK.
Revalidate price/discount/coupon/deadline/stock/commission-related strategy/shipping.

COMMERCIAL CLAIM BINDING
CommercialClaim with content/offer/type/display/source/source timestamp/expires.
Stale claims trigger REGENERATE, REMOVE_DYNAMIC_CLAIM, REQUEST_REVIEW, CANCEL.

OFFER INGESTION
Provider → Fetch → Validate → Normalize → Dedup → Version → Persist → OfferUpdated.
Handle pagination/rate limits.

COMMISSION
Rate/fixed amount/currency/tier/category/campaign/start/end/conditions/source/confidence with history snapshots. Never invent unavailable commission.

EXPECTED ECONOMIC VALUE
TrafficPotential × ClickProbability × ConversionProbability × ExpectedNetCommission × Confidence, adjusted by refund/content/AI cost/promo lifetime/inventory risk/competition.

OPPORTUNITY
product/offer/provider/promotion/audience/score/confidence/expected clicks/CVR/net commission/trend/content fit/promotion/risk/expires/explanation.
Lifecycle DISCOVERED/EVALUATING/READY/SELECTED/CAMPAIGNED/WATCH/EXPIRED/REJECTED.

COMMERCIAL RISK
price volatility, promo expiry, inventory confidence, refunds, merchant quality, freshness, commission uncertainty, provider instability.

INVENTORY
IN_STOCK/LOW_STOCK/OUT_OF_STOCK/PREORDER/UNKNOWN.
No fake low-stock urgency.

CATALOG
Normalize title/description/brand/category/variant/images/attributes/GTIN/SKU. Raw provider payload kept separately.
Dedup with GTIN/SKU/brand/model/merchant/attributes/title; ambiguous requires confidence/review.

PRODUCT QUALITY
title/description/image/attributes/offer freshness/category/claim evidence.

PROMOTION STRENGTH
price drop/history/coupon/duration/commission uplift/audience/CVR. Do not equate displayed discount with true value without valid baseline.

HISTORICAL PRICE
current, 7d median, 30d median, lowest/highest observed.
Deal class STANDARD/GOOD_VALUE/PROMOTION/STRONG_PROMOTION/PRICE_VOLATILE/INSUFFICIENT_DATA.

COUPON
code, type, value, min spend, max discount, starts/ends, eligibility, source. Validate active/eligibility/provider/minimum/end before content.

CAMPAIGN
org/name/objective/status/products/offers/provider targets/audience/persona/start/end/budget/content strategy/automation policy/primary metric/guardrails.
Objectives AWARENESS, TRAFFIC, AFFILIATE_CLICKS, CONVERSION, NET_COMMISSION, PRODUCT_TEST, CREATIVE_TEST, PROMOTION_PUSH.
States DRAFT, PLANNING, READY, ACTIVE, PAUSED, ENDING, COMPLETE, CANCELLED, ARCHIVED.

CAMPAIGN GENERATION
Opportunity+Brand+Audience+Policy+History → CampaignBrief+ContentPlan+PlatformPlan+ExperimentPlan+SchedulePlan+BudgetPlan.
AI output proposal until policy approval.

CONTENT MATRIX
Product×Persona×Platform×Format×Hook×CTA with creative budget to prevent explosion.

CAMPAIGN CALENDAR
Promo validity, content readiness, approval, platform rules, frequency, historical performance, timezone.
Never schedule stale promo claims beyond expiry.

PROMOTION EXPIRATION
Block unpublished stale promotional content, invalidate claims, cancel obsolete schedules, create revision tasks. Keep history.

OFFER EVENTS
OfferPriceChanged, PromotionChanged, PromotionExpired, InventoryChanged, CommissionChanged, OfferUnavailable.

CAMPAIGN REVALIDATION
campaign active, offer available, product eligible, promotion valid, creative current, approval valid, provider healthy. Fail closed.

MULTI-PROVIDER COMPARISON
Compare price/promo/commission/CVR/EPC/freshness. Do not claim cheapest/best without valid criterion/evidence.

DESTINATION SELECTION
audience fit/provider eligibility/offer quality/CVR/commission/data confidence/campaign strategy; persist rationale.

LINK/CREATIVE CONSISTENCY
creative → campaign → offer → affiliate link. Validate pre-publish.

CAMPAIGN VERSIONING
Version, changes, reason, actor, created_at.

BLOCKLIST/ALLOWLIST
allowed providers/merchants/categories, blocked products/keywords.

CATEGORY RISK
LOW/MEDIUM/HIGH/RESTRICTED; high risk requires extra review.

CLAIM EVIDENCE
Product claim source/reference/verified/expires/confidence.
Extract claims from caption/script/voice/thumbnail/image/video text; classify PRODUCT_FACT, PRICE, DISCOUNT, PROMOTION, INVENTORY, COMPARISON, PERFORMANCE, TESTIMONIAL, OTHER.
Mismatch blocks.

PUBLICATION COMMERCIAL SNAPSHOT
Immutable offer/price/promotion/coupon/commission/inventory/verified_at at publish.

PROMOTION ANALYTICS
promotion CTR/CVR/EPC/net commission/refund/creative performance vs baselines.

DAILY OFFER INTELLIGENCE
Sync catalog → prices → promotions → commissions → inventory → recompute opportunities → detect changes → recommendations. Idempotent.
Fast watch only within provider rules.

MISSION CONTROL
Opportunity board and campaign health with time remaining/content/approval/scheduled/published/clicks/conversions/net commission.

SECURITY
cross-tenant offer access, forged offers, unsafe redirects, payload injection, XSS, malicious media URLs, SSRF, auth bypass.
Provider text untrusted, sanitize HTML/URLs/media origins.

FIRST BOUNDED IMPLEMENTATION
Inspect product/affiliate models, read planning, separate Product/Offer, define Offer/PriceSnapshot/Promotion/freshness, tests first incl tenant/promo expiry/stale price, run tests/security, update docs/checklist/planning, one next task, STOP.
